 * op_st_lk_smem core. The I bit rides fixed zero (mask 0xFF80,
 * 128 encodings): indirect MOD0--MOD3 composes through the
 * established ST_IMMEDIATE_SMEM row and MOD4+ defers to later
 * mode rows. Table 6-18 omits ST, so the row is repeatable. */
TI_C54X_OPCODE_MASKED(ST_LK_SMEM, st_lk_smem, 0x7600, 0xFF80, 2, TI_C54X_OPERAND_LAYOUT_INDIRECT_ADDR7_EXTENSION16, TI_C54X_REPEATABILITY_ELIGIBLE, TI_C54X_INPUT_RESOURCES_NONE)

