 * to src) over the 0x6400|S<<9|D<<8 base plus lk extension word,
 * with the Smem read loading T in the read phase. TI pins no R
 * bit in this space, so the unrounded leaf covers it fully;
 * Table 6-18 omits every MAC form, so the row is repeatable. */
