/* P3-S52a POPM MMR (TI SPRU172C 4-128): word 0 pins 0x8A with the I
 * flag at bit 7 and the 7-bit MMR cookie at bits 6:0. Class 17A
 * lists no indirect MMR form, so I=1 stays claimed-but-rejected
 * in the leaf; the cookie must name an MMR (below 0x20) and the
 * TOS DATA WORD16 is read first with the observed word written
 * to the MMR DATA leg. Table 2-28 lists no POPM restriction, so
 * repeatability stays UNRESOLVED. */
TI_C54X_OPCODE_MASKED(POPM_DIRECT, popm_direct, 0x8A00, 0xFF00, 1, TI_C54X_OPERAND_LAYOUT_INDIRECT_ADDR7, TI_C54X_REPEATABILITY_UNRESOLVED, TI_C54X_INPUT_RESOURCES_STACK_POINTER)
